<title>BELGIUM: French ActivCard loss widens in 1996.</title>
<headline>French ActivCard loss widens in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Easdaq-listed French smart card maker ActivCard said in a regulatory statement its loss in 1996 widened to $11.0 million from $7.4 million in 1995.</p>
<p>But on a per-share basis the loss narrowed to $0.92 from $1.37 as the average number of shares outstanding in 1996 more than doubled to 12,006,618 from 5,384,078 in 1995.</p>
<p>Fourth quarter losses narrowed to $2.4 million from $3.7 million in the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
